---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Case Studies" description="How GreaterThan has helped principal-led businesses across New Zealand and Australia achieve their goals.">

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero hero--sub section--indigo">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--light reveal">Our work</span>
    <h1>How we've helped principal-led businesses achieve their goals.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Every business is different. Every challenge is unique. The work that takes you from where you are to where you want to be depends on reading your situation clearly and building a strategy that fits it exactly.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CASE STUDIES GRID -->
<section class="section section--paper">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="case-grid">

      <div class="case-card reveal">
        <span class="case-card__eyebrow">Strategy &amp; Advisory / Rebrand</span>
        <h3>Prodotti — New Zealand's largest Mediterranean food and drink importer</h3>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Challenge</div>
          <p>The Prodotti di Italia brand was strong in the trade but not commanding the position it should in the market. A rebrand was needed, but the business needed strategic clarity first.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Work</div>
          <p>Led the comprehensive rebrand from Prodotti di Italia to Prodotti, then continued as fractional marketing manager across the full range of brands.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Outcome</div>
          <p>Prodotti has since grown into New Zealand's largest Mediterranean food and drink importer. The rebrand created room for market expansion.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="case-card reveal d1">
        <span class="case-card__eyebrow">Execution Support / Brand launch</span>
        <h3>Visco (Australia) — Scaling premium food brands in a new market</h3>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Challenge</div>
          <p>Needed to launch and grow the De Gustibus brand in the Australian market, then build the Garofalo brand with significant social reach.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Work</div>
          <p>Marketing consultant on brand launch strategy, product positioning, and social media influencer partnerships across both brands.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Outcome</div>
          <p>De Gustibus product range listing and sales grew across the range. Garofalo saw significant expansion in SKU listings, sales, and social media engagement.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="case-card reveal">
        <span class="case-card__eyebrow">Strategy &amp; Advisory / Brand strategy</span>
        <h3>Longame — From concept to market leader</h3>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Challenge</div>
          <p>A premium coffee brand with vision but no market playbook needed to launch into a competitive segment and build brand identity from the ground up.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Work</div>
          <p>Led brand strategy and identity creation. Continues as Longame's marketing consultant from April 2025, leading all marketing aspects.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Outcome</div>
          <p>Longame has established a leading position in the premium coffee segment.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="case-card reveal d1">
        <span class="case-card__eyebrow">Strategy &amp; Advisory / Brand positioning</span>
        <h3>Strategic Specialist Group — Brand positioning and tactical marketing</h3>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Challenge</div>
          <p>Needed strategic marketing guidance and tactical campaign support to strengthen brand presence.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Work</div>
          <p>Marketing consultant from March 2024 to March 2025 on tactical marketing and brand positioning in New Zealand.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Outcome</div>
          <p>Strengthened brand positioning and successful tactical campaign execution.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="case-card reveal">
        <span class="case-card__eyebrow">Strategy &amp; Advisory / Ongoing</span>
        <h3>Anteris Psychiatry — Long-standing strategic guidance</h3>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Challenge</div>
          <p>An established psychiatry practice needed ongoing marketing guidance to support growth while maintaining clinical integrity.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Work</div>
          <p>Long-standing engagement guiding the marketing function for the practice.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Outcome</div>
          <p>Sustained growth and market presence with consistent alignment to clinical values.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="case-card reveal d1">
        <span class="case-card__eyebrow">Execution Support / Launch</span>
        <h3>Validus — Launch and sustained growth</h3>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Challenge</div>
          <p>Anteris Psychiatry launched Validus ADHD services, needing comprehensive go-to-market strategy, brand positioning, and launch execution.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Work</div>
          <p>Launch project from naming and branding through to market launch. Continues as ongoing marketing oversight.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Outcome</div>
          <p>Successful launch into the ADHD services market with sustained growth.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="case-card reveal">
        <span class="case-card__eyebrow">Strategy &amp; Advisory / Channel</span>
        <h3>Max Fitness College — Strategy and channel guidance</h3>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Challenge</div>
          <p>A fitness education provider needed marketing strategy support and guidance on digital media and supplier relationships.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Work</div>
          <p>Marketing advisor supporting strategic guidance and tactical oversight of digital channel performance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Outcome</div>
          <p>Improved strategic alignment of marketing efforts with business goals.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="case-card reveal d1">
        <span class="case-card__eyebrow">Strategy &amp; Advisory / Market entry</span>
        <h3>Lodge Cast Iron (NZ) — Market entry marketing</h3>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Challenge</div>
          <p>The NZ operation of Lodge Cast Iron needed marketing strategy and tactical support for the local market.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Work</div>
          <p>Marketing consultation supporting market positioning and brand building in New Zealand.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Outcome</div>
          <p>Established strong market positioning for Lodge Cast Iron in New Zealand.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="case-card reveal">
        <span class="case-card__eyebrow">Execution Support / Rebrand</span>
        <h3>Production Partners — Rebranding and positioning</h3>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Challenge</div>
          <p>A production services company needed strategic direction and a rebranding project to better reflect its market position.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Work</div>
          <p>Marketing advice leading to a comprehensive rebranding project delivered through an appointed brand strategy agency.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Outcome</div>
          <p>Refreshed brand identity and positioning that better communicates value in the market.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="case-card reveal d1">
        <span class="case-card__eyebrow">Execution Support / Brand launch &amp; AI</span>
        <h3>SMP&amp;C — Brand launch and AI integration</h3>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Challenge</div>
          <p>Sarah McLeod People &amp; Culture needed comprehensive go-to-market brand positioning and consistent brand application across AI-generated materials.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Work</div>
          <p>Built market positioning and branding for the launch, then translated the brand into an installable AI plugin.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-section">
          <div class="case-section__label">Outcome</div>
          <p>Successful launch with a distinctive market position and brand consistency in AI-generated content at scale.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band__inner">
      <h2>Your situation is unique. Let's talk about what's <em>possible</em>.</h2>
      <div class="cta-band__right">
        <span class="cta-band__email">hello@wearegreaterthan.co.nz</span>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary-dark">Book a discovery call <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>
